<title>DENMARK: Sell DDB, Unidanmark - Credit Suisse.</title>
<headline>Sell DDB, Unidanmark - Credit Suisse.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment bank Credit Suisse First Boston said Denmark's Den Danske Bank and Unidanmark shares are overvalued relative to earnings potential, and it advised investors to switch to Sweden's Nordbanken shares.</p>
<p>&quot;Fundamentally, both shares are at most 15 percent overvalued,&quot; it said in an analysis received by Reuters on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;Therefore, we believe there is sufficient downside risk to recommend both as sells or rather a preferred switch to Sweden, and in particular Nordbanken,&quot; it added.</p>
<p>-- Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
